the text of the_rulemap is at "sources/sgb-xii-section-1.ruml".

main is published at "eli/bund/bgbl-1/2003/s3023/2026-07-30/1/deu".

rule node_1 with provenance main at art-z1_abs-z:
Aufgabe der Sozialhilfe holds for a case if
    Beneficiary works towards independence as far as possible holds for the case
    and Beneficiary cooperates with the social assistance agency holds for the case.

rule node_2 with provenance main at art-z1_abs-z_inhalt-n1_text-n1_marker-n2:
Beneficiary works towards independence as far as possible holds for a case if
    the answer to Beneficiary works towards independence as far as possible for the case is true.

% Until a person answers, RUML's answer is undefined: the leaf holds only on the assumption below.
Beneficiary works towards independence as far as possible holds for a case if
    it is not the case that the answer to Beneficiary works towards independence as far as possible for the case is a truth value
    and Beneficiary works towards independence as far as possible would hold for the case.

rule node_3 with provenance main at art-z1_abs-z_inhalt-n1_text-n1_marker-n3:
Beneficiary cooperates with the social assistance agency holds for a case if
    the answer to Beneficiary cooperates with the social assistance agency for the case is true.

% Until a person answers, RUML's answer is undefined: the leaf holds only on the assumption below.
Beneficiary cooperates with the social assistance agency holds for a case if
    it is not the case that the answer to Beneficiary cooperates with the social assistance agency for the case is a truth value
    and Beneficiary cooperates with the social assistance agency would hold for the case.

